]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278127","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"22058","synopsis":"Continuing their journey to gather the emperor's remains, Chaika and company search for the next of the eight heroes, the wizard Simon Scania. Their search brings them to the town of Rademio, where Simon was last seen four years ago. The people of the town tell them about a \"Valley of No Return\" filled with thick fog, from which no visitors ever return.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dMmKB8zWq4naEEsCHwGHW9IWzPE.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Continuing their journey to gather the emperor's remains, Chaika and company search for the next of the eight heroes, the wizard Simon Scania. Their search brings them to the town of Rademio, where Simon was last seen four years ago. The people of the town tell them about a \"Valley of No Return\" filled with thick fog, from which no visitors ever return.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dMmKB8zWq4naEEsCHwGHW9IWzPE.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9973","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"20462","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"20853","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"60825","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"278127","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"22050","synopsis":"\"This land belongs to the Neo Gaz Empire. You'll have to pay a toll.\" A mysterious bunch professing to work for the restoration of the Gaz Empire impedes Chaika and company's path. Among them is a girl in a yellow dress whom the others call \"Princess Chaika.\" Akari's quick wit takes the party in under cover as a band of traveling performers, but Chaika takes a profound interest in these people from t